1
00:00:08,851 --> 00:00:12,992
'Reports & GST' screen par 'Sales and profit'
report hai.

2
00:00:13,032 --> 00:00:18,640
From aur To taareekh chuniye; har din ke bills,
bikri aur munaafa dikhta hai,

3
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:22,234
aur CSV button se poori report download hoti
hai.

4
00:00:22,975 --> 00:00:26,634
Best sellers mein sabse zyaada bikne wali
medicines hain,

5
00:00:26,674 --> 00:00:30,268
aur 'Expiring in 90 days' mein aane wali expiry
ki list.

6
00:00:31,019 --> 00:00:36,317
Insights screen mein gehra analysis hai: har
medicine ki bikri ka forecast,

7
00:00:36,357 --> 00:00:42,438
reorder ki salaah, dheemi ya bilkul na bikne
wali dead stock, stock in hand ki keemat,

8
00:00:42,478 --> 00:00:43,292
aur margins.

9
00:00:44,064 --> 00:00:49,270
Audit anomalies mein owner ke liye sanket hain,
jaise raat mein bane bills,

10
00:00:49,310 --> 00:00:51,578
zyaada discount ya bahut refunds.

11
00:00:51,618 --> 00:00:55,775
Yeh galti ka saboot nahi, sirf jaanchne laayak
baatein hain.

12
00:00:56,553 --> 00:01:01,456
Customer outstanding Customers screen par,
supplier outstanding Accounts mein,

13
00:01:01,496 --> 00:01:03,547
GST reports 'Reports & GST' mein,

14
00:01:03,587 --> 00:01:07,667
aur branch report dashboard ke Branch
performance mein milti hai.
